# eslint-snapshot-rule-tester format: v1


Test: class-no-inline-comment >> invalid >>> docs/rules/class-no-inline-comment.md incorrect 1
Filename: class-no-inline-comment-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | classDiagram
  2 |   Animal <|-- Duck %% ducks
    |                    ^~~~~~~~ [1]
  3 |   Animal : +int age
  4 |

Output:
  1 | classDiagram
  2 |   %% ducks
  3 |   Animal <|-- Duck
  4 |   Animal : +int age
  5 |

[1] mermaid.js reads the line break after this comment as part of the comment, so that line break does not end the statement; put the comment on a line of its own.
---


